{{!
    @template local_ltuse/pilot

    The pilot learners page (2026-10-15): a course author's trial students for one stage-7
    pilot, the form that enrols one more by exact email, and the course's visibility.
    Phone-width first: lists, no wide tables. No email address is shown. Remove opens a
    confirmation; nothing here writes on a GET.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * haslearners
    * learners: [{id, name, removeurl}]
    * visible: the course is visible to students
    * visibilitytoggle: rendered show/hide button, or empty when the viewer may not change it
    * form: rendered enrol form

    Example context (json):
    {
        "haslearners": true,
        "learners": [{"id": 2, "name": "Learner One", "removeurl": "#"}],
        "visible": false,
        "visibilitytoggle": "",
        "form": ""
    }
}}
<div class="local-ltuse-pilot">
    <p>{{#str}}pilot:intro, local_ltuse{{/str}}</p>

    <h3>{{#str}}pilot:visibility, local_ltuse{{/str}}</h3>
    <p>
    {{#visible}}{{#str}}pilot:visible, local_ltuse{{/str}}{{/visible}}
    {{^visible}}{{#str}}pilot:hidden, local_ltuse{{/str}}{{/visible}}
    </p>
    {{{visibilitytoggle}}}

    <h3 class="mt-4">{{#str}}pilot:learners, local_ltuse{{/str}}</h3>
    {{^haslearners}}
    <p class="text-muted">{{#str}}pilot:nolearners, local_ltuse{{/str}}</p>
    {{/haslearners}}
    {{#haslearners}}
    <ul class="list-unstyled">
        {{#learners}}
        <li class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center border-bottom py-2">
            <span>{{name}}</span>
            <a class="btn btn-link" href="{{removeurl}}">{{#str}}pilot:remove, local_ltuse{{/str}}</a>
        </li>
        {{/learners}}
    </ul>
    {{/haslearners}}

    {{{form}}}
</div>
